ing."}],"answer":"B","explanation":"Can 的肯定回答是 Yes, I can。","verify":"\"Yes, I can.\""},{"id":"cne_p122_q4","topicId":"cne_p122","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"He cannot dance. 这句的意思是？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他会跳舞"},{"key":"B","text":"他正在跳舞"},{"key":"C","text":"他不会跳舞"},{"key":"D","text":"他喜欢跳舞"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"cannot dance 是不会跳舞。","verify":"\"他不会跳舞\""},{"id":"cne_p123_q1","topicId":"cne_p123","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"想问对方会做什么，应说哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"What can you do?"},{"key":"B","text":"What do you look like?"},{"key":"C","text":"What would you like?"},{"key":"D","text":"What do you have?"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"问能力用 What can you do?","verify":"\"What can you do?\""},{"id":"cne_p123_q2","topicId":"cne_p123","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"I can sing and dance. 会做哪两件事？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"画画和游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"唱歌和跳舞"},{"key":"C","text":"只唱歌"},{"key":"D","text":"只跳舞"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"sing and dance。","verify":"\"唱歌和跳舞\""},{"id":"cne_p123_q3","topicId":"cne_p123","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"Can you swim? 若不会，应回答哪一句？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"No, I do not."},{"key":"B","text":"Yes, I can."},{"key":"C","text":"No, I cannot."},{"key":"D","text":"No, I am not."}],"answer":"C","explanation":"Can 的否定回答是 No, I cannot。","verify":"\"No, I cannot.\""},{"id":"cne_p123_q4","topicId":"cne_p123","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"We can draw pictures for the party. 能为聚会做什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"唱歌"},{"key":"C","text":"做饭"},{"key":"D","text":"画画"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"draw pictures 是画画。","verify":"\"画画\""},{"id":"cne_p124_q1","topicId":"cne_p124","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：John can swim. Amy can draw. 谁会游泳？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"Amy"},{"key":"B","text":"John"},{"key":"C","text":"Sarah"},{"key":"D","text":"Mike"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"John can swim。","verify":"\"John\""},{"id":"cne_p124_q2","topicId":"cne_p124","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：I can sing English songs. 哪一句和短文一致？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"我会跳舞。"},{"key":"B","text":"我不会唱歌。"},{"key":"C","text":"我会唱英文歌。"},{"key":"D","text":"我会画画。"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"sing English songs。","verify":"\"我会唱英文歌。\""},{"id":"cne_p124_q3","topicId":"cne_p124","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：What can you do? I can dance. 这个人会什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"画画"},{"key":"C","text":"做饭"},{"key":"D","text":"跳舞"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"I can dance。","verify":"\"跳舞\""},{"id":"cne_p124_q4","topicId":"cne_p124","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"读一读：Zhang Peng cannot cook, but he can swim. Zhang Peng 会什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"游泳"},{"key":"B","text":"做饭"},{"key":"C","text":"唱歌"},{"key":"D","text":"画画"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"cannot cook，但是 can swim。","verify":"\"游泳\""},{"id":"cne_p167_q1","topicId":"cne_p167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「爱好」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"hobby"},{"key":"B","text":"hiking"},{"key":"C","text":"puzzle"},{"key":"D","text":"dancing"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"hobby 的意思是爱好。","verify":"\"hobby\""},{"id":"cne_p167_q2","topicId":"cne_p167","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「hiking」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"爱好"},{"key":"B","text":"远足"},{"key":"C","text":"谜题"},{"key":"D","text":"跳舞"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"hiking 的意思是远足。","verify":"\"远足\""},{"id":"cne_p167_q3","topicId":"cne_p167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「谜题」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"hobby"},{"key":"B","text":"hiking"},{"key":"C","text":"puzzle"},{"key":"D","text":"dancing"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"表示谜题的单词是 puzzle。","verify":"\"puzzle\""},{"id":"cne_p167_q4","topicId":"cne_p167","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「跳舞」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":