:"远足"},{"key":"D","text":"唱歌"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"hobby is hiking。","verify":"\"远足\""},{"id":"cne_p171_q1","topicId":"cne_p171","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「工厂」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"factory"},{"key":"B","text":"worker"},{"key":"C","text":"postman"},{"key":"D","text":"businessman"}],"answer":"A","explanation":"factory 的意思是工厂。","verify":"\"factory\""},{"id":"cne_p171_q2","topicId":"cne_p171","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"「worker」的中文意思是哪一个？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"工厂"},{"key":"B","text":"工人"},{"key":"C","text":"邮递员"},{"key":"D","text":"商人"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"worker 的意思是工人。","verify":"\"工人\""},{"id":"cne_p171_q3","topicId":"cne_p171","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"选择表示「邮递员」的单词。","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"factory"},{"key":"B","text":"worker"},{"key":"C","text":"postman"},{"key":"D","text":"businessman"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"表示邮递员的单词是 postman。","verify":"\"postman\""},{"id":"cne_p171_q4","topicId":"cne_p171","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"哪个单词的意思是「商人」？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"factory"},{"key":"B","text":"worker"},{"key":"C","text":"postman"},{"key":"D","text":"businessman"}],"answer":"D","explanation":"businessman 的意思是商人。","verify":"\"businessman\""},{"id":"cne_p172_q1","topicId":"cne_p172","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"What does he do? 这句是在问什么？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"他正在做什么"},{"key":"B","text":"他是做什么工作的"},{"key":"C","text":"他喜欢做什么"},{"key":"D","text":"他昨天做了什么"}],"answer":"B","explanation":"What does he do 问职业。","verify":"\"他是做什么工作的\""},{"id":"cne_p172_q2","topicId":"cne_p172","difficulty":"basic","type":"choice","prompt":"He works in a factory. 他在哪里工作？","choices":[{"key":"A","text":"邮局"},{"key":"B","text":"医院"},{"key":"C","text":"工厂"},{"key":"D","text":"学校"}],"answer":"C","explanation":"factory 是工厂。","verify":"\"工厂\""},{"id":"cne_p172_q3","topicId":"cne_p172","difficulty":"standard","type":"choice","prompt":"